ials that prioritize skin health By fermenting French hot spring water, finer active ingredient particles are absorbed deep into the skin, providing excellent moisturizing and soothing effects. [How to use] 1 Take an appropriate amount, apply on dry face and gently massage to remove makeup. 2 Add a little water to your hands and massage your face for about 30 seconds. 3 Wash thoroughly with lukewarm water. [Volume] 100ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #banila co ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ——————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ———————————', 159.72, 105.2, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Makeup Removers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rccu-ltkk8feol2za5f', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F24171963632', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
