g 6types shipping from korea Product Details 🖤 Those who want eyebrows that are easily and quickly created. Color matching #soft texture #long lasting. 🖤 Soft drawing that does not clump even after layering. The soft texture expresses natural eyebrows without clumping. 🖤 Elaborate brows that can be completed without shaving. It is an automatic dagger type that does not need to be sharpened, and fills in the brow area quickly and easily. 🖤 Long-lasting effect that is not easily erased With excellent durability, it is not easily erased by water or sweat, so it maintains clear brows for a long time. [Makeup tips] After holding the guide line of the eyebrows with the hair part of the brow, fill in the color from the 2/3 point of the eyebrows to the tail. Brush along the eyebrows with the built-in blending brush to create natural, clean eyebrows. [Product capacity] 0.15g [Options] black dark brown gray brown red brown brown light brown black refill dark brown refill gray brown refill red brown refill brown refill light brown refill #Good Price #Good Quality #Korean Cosmetics #K-Beauty ————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ♡Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√', 26.07, 9.32, NULL, 'Beauty > Makeup > Eyes', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rcdh-ltce2wi22ewh4d', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F21197287454', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
