29 x 29 x 28 cm Peso líquido: 2,4 kg Peso bruto: 3,1 kg Garantia: 6 meses', 320.0, 259.0, NULL, 'Home Appliances > Kitchen Appliances > Multi-function Cookers', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825av-mq6cv06zvggbcf', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F889973435%2F58251181182', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
