o de Limpeza: Utilize pano úmido.', 375.73, 300.59, NULL, 'Home & Living > Furniture > Cupboards & Cabinets', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-823og-mojwrqckg00db7', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F375188138%2F22997064726', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
