e amount on the palm of your hand and make enough foam. STEP 2 After foaming enough, gently rub onto face to massage. STEP 3 Rinse the foam thoroughly with lukewarm water. [Product capacity] 100g #Green tea #foam cleansing #moist skin #cleansing #hypoallergenic #old dead skin #sebum secretion control #delicate foam #pore cleansing #removal of wastes #clean skin #K-beauty ------------------------------------------------------------ ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ---------- ------- ❤Three Promises of KOKSARA COSMETICS 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.✔ 2.We sell 100% genuine.✔ 3.Chatable time: all the time [24/7].', 73.56, 73.56, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Facial Cleanser', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/c5d0ad28fed9c00cb9cd6afd05fa0df0', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F12364097939', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
