tia de 273 Dias. • Valor do Kit.', 795.84, 748.09, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Lighting', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rbmb-m5lvcsgnsups72', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F463375702%2F22998169803', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
